Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,LOVEMI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.12,0:00:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,LOVEMI. LOVEMI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.80,0:00:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,KILL ME KILL ME
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.49,0:00:11.20,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&H0200E9&\3c&H000000&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The music and the music.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.46,0:00:38.63,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,650)\c&H2E2C2C&}JUJUTSU KAISEN\N{\fs12\c&HF3F3F3&\bord0\alpha&HFF&\t(237,736,1 \alpha&H00&)}The Culling Game Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will admit myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.34,0:00:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fear of fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.10,0:00:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth and truth and truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.94,0:00:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what my life is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.18,0:00:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care about this song.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't say no. High tension.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The role of the play is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.06,0:00:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a big fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me! Love me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.10,0:00:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a fighter. Love me! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.45,0:01:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me! Love me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.37,0:01:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.84,0:01:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:01:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, child of\NZenin, descendant of Michizane,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.67,0:01:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cursed womb death painting,\Nand vessel of Sukuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.58,0:02:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you don't have a\Ngreeting for me, Tengen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.49,0:02:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.41,0:02:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This person... Person... It's Tengen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.32,0:02:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not our first time\Nmeeting, Yuki Sukumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.23,0:02:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me why you closed\Nthe Tombs of the Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.15,0:02:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wary of you being\Naligned with Kenjaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.06,0:02:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell what's going on in\Npeople's hearts, after all. Kenjaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.97,0:02:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was once Noritoshi Kamo,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.82,0:02:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sorcerer who's currently\Ninhabiting Suguru Gato's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.64,0:02:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A net of compassion and\Na rope of salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.74,0:02:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't even trying for sarcasm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look nothing like how\NI pictured you, Tengen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ballsy to insert himself\Ninto the conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just because I'm immortal\Ndoesn't make me ageless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.92,0:02:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd look like this too\Nif you were 500 years old.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.59,0:02:30.80,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(182,60)\fad(425,0)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs16\bord0\shad0\c&H3A267C&}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.70,0:02:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.60,0:02:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My aging has sped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.74,0:02:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since I failed to assimilate with\Nthe Star Plasma vessel 12 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.32,0:02:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my identity as an individual has vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.26,0:02:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you can consider my\Nexistence as the world itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.88,0:02:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there wasn't actually another\NStar Plasma vessel back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.78,0:02:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That explains why there isn't a new voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.60,0:02:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We came here to learn Kenjaku's goal,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.30,0:03:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and also to learn about how\Nto open the prison realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.10,0:03:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you tell us what you know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.40,0:03:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I must impose one condition\Nfirst, and it's non-negotiable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.90,0:03:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuta Okkotsu, Yuji Tsukumo, and\Nthe Cursed Womb Death Painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll need two of you three\Nto remain behind here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.42,0:03:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remain behind and guard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.16,0:03:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guard you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.42,0:03:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you're immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid of being\Nsealed or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.32,0:03:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.06,0:03:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without telling us why or\Nhow long we're guarding you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.42,0:03:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me speak of Kenjaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.58,0:03:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man's objective is to force the\Nevolution of mankind throughout all of Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.12,0:03:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard about that. But how\Ndoes he actually intend?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.12,0:04:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to do it and why didn't\NKenjaku use your barriers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back when he could to\Nturn everyone in Japan
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.30,0:04:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into Jujutsu sorcerers\Nwith idle transfiguration?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a simple reason he lacked\Nthe cursed energy to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cursed energy refined through\Nmaelstrom can't return to the sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.92,0:04:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides a curse technique evolving people\None at a time is far too inefficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.10,0:04:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Kenjaku's new method of evolution\Nis to assimilate mankind with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.10,0:04:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your assimilation should
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.18,0:04:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only be possible with\Nthe star plasma vessel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.56,0:04:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Previously that was true but since\NI started evolving 12 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.24,0:04:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,assimilation with someone other than\Nthe star plasma vessel is possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.92,0:04:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so you're only one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:05:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He still can't assimilate with\Nmultiple people at once. Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.94,0:05:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now the image you are seeing\Nof me is not my actual self.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.90,0:05:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I've evolved, my soul\Nis everywhere all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.42,0:05:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said before the world\Nitself is who I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People who assimilated with me would\Nbecome something more than a sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'd become a new creature that at the\Nsame time is both there and not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.32,0:05:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is because of my barrier\Ntechniques that I was able
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to retain my shape and reason\Nafter I started evolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, if mankind\Nwere to begin evolving,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.82,0:05:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if only one person\Nwent out of control,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.12,0:05:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the world would end. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.64,0:05:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There would be no boundaries\Nbetween individuals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evil would spread to all instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.12,0:05:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The impurities of a hundred million\Npeople would flood the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.52,0:05:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened in Tokyo would be\Nrecreated on a worldwide scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would make him want\Nto do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.24,0:05:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That, I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.28,0:05:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I said, there's no telling\Nwhat's inside people's hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as long as you reject the\Nassimilation, won't everything be fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.62,0:06:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we're getting to why I need guarding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.22,0:06:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I have evolved,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.38,0:06:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my nature is closer to that of a cursed\Nspirit than it is to that of a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.18,0:06:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I can be targeted by\Ncursed spirit manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.20,0:06:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Considering Kenjaku's enormous\Nstrength as a sorcerer,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would likely be absorbed the\Nmoment he made contact with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.68,0:06:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why my main body is rejecting\Neverything in the tombs of the star right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.22,0:06:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you need guarding?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.99,0:06:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kenjaku is second only to me in\Nhis skill with barrier techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know when he'll manage to break\Nthe seal on the tombs of the star.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.90,0:06:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.64,0:06:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The star plasma vessel\Nassimilation failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.14,0:06:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been forced to evolve,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.38,0:06:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he wants to absorb you with\Ncursed energy manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.24,0:06:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It also seems Kenjaku has\Nconnections to Sukuna,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:07:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means he's been a sorcerer\Nfor at least 1,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.66,0:07:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.90,0:07:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Star Plasma Vessel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.24,0:07:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the Six Eyes are all connected by\Nfate and intertwined with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.38,0:07:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twice in the past, Kenjaku was stopped\Nby the Sorcerer with the Six Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.24,0:07:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The second time, he was thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.16,0:07:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He killed both the Star\NPlasma Vessel and the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.28,0:07:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bearer of the Six Eyes within\Na month of their birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.24,0:07:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.15,0:07:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Six Eyes and the Star Plasma Vessel
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.06,0:07:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,still appeared by the\Nday of my assimilation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.84,0:07:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.86,0:07:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kenjaku altered his strategy to\Nfocus on sealing the Six Eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.00,0:07:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,instead of killing him as he began\Nsearching for the prison realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.74,0:07:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, there can't be two people\Nwith the Six Eyes at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.12,0:07:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, 12 years ago, something\Nunpredictable happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.54,0:07:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toji Zenin intervened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was physically gifted\Nthrough a heavenly pact,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he was unique among them for being\Ncompletely free from cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.20,0:08:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since his heavenly pact\Nplaced him outside of fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he decided to destroy the\Nvery fate that connected us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.98,0:08:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, a young man with the power of\Ncursed spirit manipulation appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.58,0:08:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without even trying,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.86,0:08:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he now had all the necessary\Npieces except for the Prison Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.42,0:08:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But six years ago, the Prison Realm made\Nits way into Kenjaku's hands as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.50,0:08:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Kenjaku has the Prison Realm, then\Nwhy is this Culling Game being hosted?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a warm-up before assimilation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.76,0:08:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My assimilation with people other than\Nthe Star Plasma Vessel is possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.02,0:08:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but at the moment there's a high probability\Nit will result in something incomplete.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.45,0:08:42.46,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(320,43.333)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord0\shad0\c&H000000&\fs30}The Culling Game
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.62,0:08:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Culling Game uses the cursed energy\Nof the players and the boundaries formed
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.46,0:08:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,between the colonies in a ritual to send\Nthis nation's people to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He probably plans to use that as a warm-up\Nto start their assimilation with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.44,0:08:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, to establish that ritual,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.94,0:08:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kenjaku should have been\Nforced to accept several pacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of those pacts is that\NKenjaku is not allowed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.74,0:09:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to name himself the\NCulling Game's Game Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.74,0:09:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, that's a\Ndisadvantage to you as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.54,0:09:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because it means that killing\NKenjaku won't end the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.36,0:09:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either all of the players must die,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.86,0:09:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or the players must all\Nrefuse to participate and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rules specifically\Nmention that nothing must
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,significantly hinder the\Ncontinuation of the Culling Game,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.44,0:09:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an insurance policy to prevent\Nthe ritual from being stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case... Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of us need to participate\Nin the Culling Game,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.10,0:09:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and add a rule that creates\Na way out of the game
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.78,0:09:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for Choso and those\Nreluctant to participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.22,0:09:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to free Gojo-sensei\Nat the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.06,0:09:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could resolve this\Nall entirely on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.56,0:09:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what do we do next?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.78,0:10:00.12,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(424,88)\fad(800,0)\c&H88708D&\bord0\shad0\fs20}Tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:10:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, please decide which\Nof you will stay behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.38,0:10:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.58,0:10:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.60,0:10:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuji, you will absolutely need\Nthe help of Okkotsu or that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.06,0:10:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noritoshi Kamo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.70,0:10:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Kenjaku comes, that's all the\Nmore reason for me to guard Tengen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.42,0:10:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must do so because slaying him\Nwould mean saving my younger brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.62,0:10:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still not finished\Ntalking with Tengen just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.22,0:10:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that sound okay, Okkotsu? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.98,0:10:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be separated\Nfrom everyone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.80,0:10:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.78,0:10:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the back of the prison realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you plan to free Satoru\NGojo, you'll need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.72,0:10:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.63,0:10:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I've heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.64,0:10:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a back door.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before Kenjaku found it, the prison\Nrealm was outside of my barriers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably somewhere abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.72,0:10:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought keeping this back sealed would.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.60,0:11:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,obscure the presence of the\Nfront, but it didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.70,0:11:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satoru Gojo is also\Nsealed away within this
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.14,0:11:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back gate. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's open it and let him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.10,0:11:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, the authority to open the gates rests\Nwith the owner of the front, Kenjaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.90,0:11:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to break this one open,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.00,0:11:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you need either the inverted\Nspear of heaven that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can force the cancellation\Nof cursed techniques,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.08,0:11:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or something that can disrupt and cancel\Nout the effects of a cursed technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.30,0:11:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The black rope could
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.02,0:11:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.93,0:11:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, twelve years ago Satoru Gojo\Neither sealed the inverted spear of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.76,0:11:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heaven abroad or destroyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.78,0:11:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you do that sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.66,0:11:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And last year the black rope was\Nalso completely frayed by Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.22,0:11:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was he thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.86,0:11:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reminds me of Miguel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.38,0:11:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We went to Africa looking for\Nsome more of that black rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.16,0:11:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me you found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.20,0:11:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but it was a\Ncomplete waste of effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.48,0:11:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said it's all gone.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.70,0:12:01.03,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(332.667,89.333)\fad(925,0)\fs14\shad0\c&H3E3B3E&\3c&HF3EEEE&}They said it's all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.90,0:12:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there another way? There is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Among the players participating\Nin the upcoming Culling Game,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.96,0:12:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a sorcerer from 1,000\Nyears ago who calls herself Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.18,0:12:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her curse technique can extinguish\Nany other curse technique.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.97,0:12:30.97,Ep_Title,Sign,0,0,0,,Episode 50\N{\fs30}About the Culling Game
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.74,0:12:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Extinguish any curse technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Angel's cursed technique can\Nopen the Back of the Prison Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you tell us where she is right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.46,0:12:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's in the colony on\Nthe east side of Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.44,0:12:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The barriers of the\Nculling game reject me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.74,0:12:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I don't have any\Nmore information than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.02,0:12:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's start going over things from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are ten colonies across Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.28,0:13:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are linked together\Nby barriers designed to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.88,0:13:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ferry the country's people\Nover to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.78,0:13:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crossing a river or other border.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.42,0:13:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,acts that symbolize crossing\Nover to the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.12,0:13:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These carry important meanings in sorcery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.64,0:13:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's like with Yasohachi Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.62,0:13:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Jujutsu Society's barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.26,0:13:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So is Hokkaido excluded?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.04,0:13:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.95,0:13:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That land is already established\Nas a vast sacred ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.20,0:13:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that's the\Nchallenging land for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.59,0:13:44.09,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\pos(613,173)\an3\bord0}*"The Challenging Land"\NThe catchphrase issued in '99 by \Nthe Hokkaido Government Office.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.56,0:13:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ferry them to the other side\Nmay sound a bit dramatic,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but everyone in Japan was cursed in\Npreparation for the upcoming assimilation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.12,0:14:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me about this ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long will it take to complete?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.22,0:14:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Depends on the culling game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.16,0:14:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My guess it's over in two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.14,0:14:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is currently 9 a .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.22,0:14:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on the 9th of November.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.04,0:14:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nine days since the players\Nawakened as sorcerers,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.56,0:14:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which happened October\NCity around midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.66,0:14:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That gives us about 10 days and 15 hours\Nto go before Tsumiki is forced to play.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.13,0:14:28.09,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnGeorgia\c&H0800E3&}Remaining Time Until Tsumiki\NMust Enter the Culling Game
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.09,0:14:30.80,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnGeorgia\fs16\bord2\c&H0800E3&\b1\pos(312,58)}Remaining Time Until Tsumiki\NMust Enter the Culling Game
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.09,0:14:30.80,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnGeorgia\fs16\bord2\c&H0800E3&\pos(291.333,257.333)\b1}Obtain 100 points and add a rule\Nallowing people to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tengen, you said before that people\Nwould die if they refused to participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.88,0:14:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.18,0:14:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They get stripped of their technique, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.50,0:14:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that rule also applies\Nto any sorcerers joining in later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.10,0:14:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, the stripping isn't\Nbeing done by idle transfiguration.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.00,0:14:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a pact either, because\Nit says stripped, not prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:15:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that probably means it'll be doing\Nsomething to the brain by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.54,0:15:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's better for the rules if\Nbeing stripped means death, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.46,0:15:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, everyone would\Nrefuse to participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.48,0:15:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just as Shoko anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that also means there's no risk to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.30,0:15:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sorcerers without any\Ncursed technique like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.22,0:15:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what'll happen to Panda?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he even have a brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.50,0:15:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About this rule,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what does it mean for the ordinary people\Nwho are in the colony from the start?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.00,0:15:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means anyone who wants will be\Ngranted at least one chance to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.82,0:15:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.00,0:15:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How awfully generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.28,0:15:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no stipulations in the rules\Nabout leaving or entering colonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.12,0:15:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were probably trying to stimulate\Nthe culling game by giving players
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.80,0:15:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a clear first-time goal of leaving\Nthe colony with their lives intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to keep the players\Ninside for the duration.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.50,0:15:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The premise that players\Nentered of their own free will?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.20,0:15:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is extremely important.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.38,0:16:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eno mentioned that thing about\Nadjusting the barrier strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using fundamentally in a rule?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.84,0:16:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why make it confusing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.48,0:16:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.32,0:16:21.59,Onscreen2,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H0700E1&\pos(320,61.333)}Game Master
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.38,0:16:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tengen, who is this Game Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.80,0:16:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every individual player is\Ngiven a Shikigami called Kogane.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.94,0:16:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be precise, Kogane\Nisn't the Game Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.66,0:16:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an interface.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.78,0:16:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's best to think of the culling\Ngame itself as the Game Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.88,0:16:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we can add, but we're not allowed\Nto eliminate any existing rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.58,0:16:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we'll be able to come up\Nwith some kind of workaround.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that allowed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.44,0:16:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.70,0:17:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It leans too heavily\Non their own judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.86,0:17:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.77,0:17:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should expect a fair decision\Nwhen it comes to all challenges.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.18,0:17:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're already subjecting the\Nplayers to such stringent rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.76,0:17:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jujutsu Sorcery would not allow them to\Nshow more favoritism towards Kenjaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.72,0:17:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, does that mean I'll\Nbe killing people again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.44,0:17:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.68,0:17:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a few ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've managed to organize\Nour information for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.58,0:17:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That just leaves the roles for each of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.34,0:17:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki and Choso will remain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.72,0:17:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll guard Tengen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.76,0:17:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, I need to return to the\NZenin house to get their cursed tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.70,0:17:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right after Gojo was sealed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Kamo and Zenin clans\Nboth took their cursed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.76,0:17:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tools out of Jujutsu\NHigh's Forbidden Vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.32,0:17:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, Megumi is now the\Nhead of the Zenin clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.21,0:17:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain it to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.26,0:17:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we're free to rummage through\Nthe Zenion's forbidden vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before that, Tengen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.74,0:18:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.32,0:18:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Juzo Kumio's Atelier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.98,0:18:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.38,0:18:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I'm finished, I'll look for Panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.74,0:18:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, I'll help deal\Nwith the Culling Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.26,0:18:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you, Yuta?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.06,0:18:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll enter a colony and\Nparticipate in the Culling Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.80,0:18:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sooner, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.06,0:18:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before Sumiki and Fushiguro enter,\NI want to know as much as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll be thoroughly prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.50,0:18:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.26,0:18:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll mean acting on my own again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.04,0:18:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.95,0:18:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in order to prevent us from\Nclashing with each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.10,0:18:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and in case something does\Nhappen to Tsumiki out there,?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.66,0:18:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll avoid the nearby colonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.50,0:18:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be aware that the\Ncolonies might cut off reception,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.64,0:18:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I might be out of contact for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.76,0:18:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Sukuna appears and takes control\Nof me again, I need you to kill me.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.01,0:18:52.65,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(15,35)\fs14\c&H100D04&\bord0\shad0}They're thinking that having Okkotsu near\NItadori would keep Fushiguro safe, but it\Nwould be a more efficient use of their\Nforces for Okkotsu to act alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.70,0:18:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.26,0:18:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that happens, you\Ncan have him kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.98,0:19:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I'm trying\Nto avoid that situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.74,0:19:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.10,0:19:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.06,0:19:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you two to meet up\Nwith Kinji like we planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.36,0:19:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinji?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.76,0:19:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinji Hakari.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.08,0:19:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The third-year guy that got suspended.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.66,0:19:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're shorthanded, so\Nit's all hands on deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.28,0:19:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do whatever it takes to recruit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.44,0:19:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he strong at least?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.90,0:19:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a bit erratic, but if he gets into\Nit, he can be even stronger than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.30,0:19:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.98,0:20:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.89,0:20:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to thank you for all the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.62,0:20:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't die out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really crying? Shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.70,0:20:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.22,0:20:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Takaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.86,0:20:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long are you going\Nto keep doing that crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.26,0:20:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.17,0:20:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're making me depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.84,0:20:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The audience, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.70,0:20:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.76,0:20:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How old are you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.88,0:20:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,35 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.42,0:20:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give it up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.20,0:20:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our industry is full of late bloomers who\Nsuddenly make it big for no good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.38,0:20:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not a single one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.80,0:21:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of the blue suddenly\Nactually became funnier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were already funny people\Nwaiting patiently to be discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.88,0:21:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ain't the case for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.80,0:21:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look what happened to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.72,0:21:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's gonna think ill of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.14,0:21:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go do something you're\Nactually suited for.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.40,0:21:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always thought you were kind of funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.82,0:21:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always made me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.60,0:21:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean it, Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.00,0:21:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both you and him have the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are people who ain't\Nfunny that still make it big.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.08,0:21:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they one-gag comics like me, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.18,0:21:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.09,0:21:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are two types of comedians\Nthat manage to stay big
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.80,0:21:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,comedians who are always funny\Nand comedians who can go ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.50,0:21:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and delude themselves into
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.64,0:21:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,believing they
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.55,0:21:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are so
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.04,0:21:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which type
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.28,0:21:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you well? I'd like to think\NI'm 50-50, but in actuality,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.06,0:22:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's probably a lot closer to 70-30.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.94,0:22:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,50-50 or 70-30!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.72,0:22:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.74,0:23:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's scary for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.40,0:23:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Na-zori na-kara nukau no-ho so!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:51.99,0:23:55.02,Next_Ep_Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\be2}Next Episode\N{\fs30}Perfect Preparation

